1
00:00:00,069 --> 00:00:03,369
(Sheldon:)But, um, I did have you.

2
00:00:03,573 --> 00:00:08,013
And every day at 4:00,
you'd come to my house on Channel 68...

3
00:00:08,211 --> 00:00:10,271
(Sheldon:)...and we'd do science together.

4
00:00:10,680 --> 00:00:14,640
(Sheldon:)If it hadn't been for you, well, who knows
what would have become of me, you know?

5
00:00:14,851 --> 00:00:20,151
(Sheldon:)Instead of a world-class physicist,
I could've wound up as a hobo...

6
00:00:20,790 --> 00:00:23,050
(Sheldon:)...or a surgeon.

7
00:00:24,260 --> 00:00:27,200
(Leonard:)I bet there are important discoveries
being made every day...

8
00:00:27,397 --> 00:00:31,197
(Leonard:)...because you inspired millions of kids
to pursue science.

9
00:00:31,401 --> 00:00:33,731
(Leonard:)In a way, their discoveries
are your discoveries.

10
00:00:33,937 --> 00:00:38,927
(Sheldon:)It's true. A generation of young scientists
are standing on your shoulders.

11
00:00:40,276 --> 00:00:45,076
Well, thank you, guys. That means a lot.

12
00:00:45,615 --> 00:00:48,745
Well, it's important you know
how much you mean to us.

13
00:00:49,185 --> 00:00:52,245
- Uh-oh.
- Arthur, are you okay?

14
00:00:52,622 --> 00:00:54,922
(Arthur:)I'm having...

15
00:00:55,625 --> 00:00:57,755
(Arthur:)...a problem with my pacemaker.

